ary Muenster","x":"…out in previous releases such as the gain on the Doble building sale, certain restructuring and cost-reduction actions that we've undertaken and last year's impact of U.S. Tax Reform, I will once again focus my prepared remarks on the adjusted numbers as these are more relevant measures of our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/esco-technologies-ese-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ESE 2019 Q2","e":"ese","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gary Muenster","x":"Plus given our year-to-date performance and our favorable outlook for the back half of the year, our confidence is reflected by raising our full year guidance, as Vic noted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/esco-technologies-ese-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ESE 2019 Q3","e":"ese","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Richey","x":"And we will provide cost savings and productivity enhancements in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/esco-technologies-ese-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ESE 2019 Q4","e":"ese","d":"2019-11-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vic Richey","x":"So we don't have any tariff issues coming in this direction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/20/esco-technologies-ese-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ESE 2020 Q2","e":"ese","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Richey","x":"The beauty of these current cost reduction initiatives is they're being done and implemented with minimal cost to achieve, thereby maintaining our flexibility to ramp up quickly should demand increase as customers, communities, and countries reopen their economies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/esco-technologies-ese-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ESE 2020 Q2","e":"ese","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gar